  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.41 Knight's Pond. No person shall operate a motorboat on Knight's Pond in the town of Alton.\n\nSource. #4347, eff 12-22-87; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 402.38); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04; ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.31); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.37) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
